---
description: Laravel 8 conventions for miyi-app
globs:
  - "app/**/*.php"
  - "routes/**/*.php"
  - "database/**/*.php"
---

- Models live in `App\Models\` under `app/Models/`. Prefer `RelatedModel::class` in relations, not string FQCNs.
- API controllers: `App\Http\Controllers\Api\V1\...`. Routes use string controller@action; `RouteServiceProvider` sets controller namespace.
- Validation: `App\Http\Requests\...`. API resources: `App\Http\Resources\...`.
- Shared logic: `App\Services\...`. Observers: `App\Observers\...` (register in `AppServiceProvider`).
- Migrations using `->change()` require `doctrine/dbal` (already in `composer.json`).
- Do not reintroduce Telescope, Spatie Backup, or AWS S3 adapter unless product explicitly requires it.
